{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_14","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"rg -n 'Step 1|step1|569 assertions|279 assertions|yin.repl.index-test|DATOM_SLOW|clojure|0 failures|0 errors|repair|Node|Dart' /Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/collab/dao-stream/1794147282000-engineer-step1-invariant-pins.muse-wonder-1.0.stdout.log | tail -70; ls -l /opt/homebrew/bin/git /Applications/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer/usr/bin/git /Library/Developer/CommandLineTools/usr/bin/git\"","aggregated_output":"10:Step 1 is complete. Existing invariants are green and the publication-result expectations are now explicit, with all changes contained in `test/yin/repl/` and no `src/` edits (uncommitted, for review).\n26:| `yin.repl.index-test` | 21 tests, 242 assertions | 27 tests, 569 assertions, 0 failures |\n27:| `yin.repl.require-test` | 20 tests, 172 assertions | 20 tests, 209 assertions, 0 failures |\n28:| `yin.repl.query-test` | 18 tests, 246 assertions | 18 tests, 279 assertions, 0 failures |\n29:| `yin.repl.store-test` | 27 tests, 132 assertions | 28 tests, 145 assertions, 0 failures |\n31:The slow query settlement var also passes on both backends (16 assertions). Node/Dart lanes were not run (focused JVM runs only, per instructions); the fixture is reader-conditional portable, but that remains unverified. Generated ANTLR parser classes were seeded into the gitignored `build/` cache so the JVM lane could run at all; the working tree carries no build changes.\n33:**Finding for Step 2 (not pinned, not fixed — `src/` is out of Step 1 scope):** continuing the shell past a refused publication throws inside `yin.repl.index/notice`, which renders `(name stage)` of the cleared failure and rolls the round back. I verified this on unmodified engine code with a debug script; the failed-HEAD pin therefore proves the retry at the indexer level and documents the defect at the shell level.\nls: /opt/homebrew/bin/git: No such file or directory\n-rwxr-xr-x  1 root  wheel  3838240 Oct 20 09:01 /Applications/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer/usr/bin/git\n-rwxr-xr-x  1 root  wheel  3837392 Sep  2 10:44 /Library/Developer/CommandLineTools/usr/bin/git\n","exit_code":1,"status":"failed"}}
