\\t   :task (System/exit\\\\\\\\n   227\\\\\\\\t           (:exit (apply shell {:continue true} \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"sh\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"-c\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\n   228\\\\\\\\t                         \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\". build/tools/jolt-env.sh && exec \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"$JOLT_HOME/bin/jolt\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"$@\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"jolt\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\n   229\\\\\\\\t                         *command-line-args*)))}\\\\\\\\n   230\\\\\\\\t\\\\\\\\n   231\\\\\\\\t  build:yin-repl-node\\\\\\\\n   232\\\\\\\\t  {:doc \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Compile the Node yin.repl (shadow-cljs build :yin-repl) to target/yin-repl.js\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\n   233\\\\\\\\t   ;; The Node lanes (test:cljs and its variants) depend on this task, so the\\\\\\\\n   234\\\\\\\\t   ;; generated JavaScript parser reaches them through it.\\\\\\\\n   235\\\\\\\\t   :depends [deps:npm gen:antlr]\\\\\\\\n   236\\\\\\\\t   ;; yin.repl.dht-process-test spawns it as the JVM-to-Node reader of\\\\\\\\n   237\\\\\\\\t   ;; DHT epic S5, a required leg: a missing build fails that test.\\\\\\\\n   238\\\\\\\\t   :task (shell \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"clj -M:cljs -m shadow.cljs.devtools.cli compile yin-repl\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\")}\\\\\\\\n   239\\\\\\\\t\\\\\\\\n   240\\\\\\\\t  build:yin-repl-peer\\\\\\\\n   241\\\\\\\\t  {:doc \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Compile the yin.repl R5 cross-host peer (client role and --serve server role) as a Dart exe\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\n   242\\\\\\\\t   ;; The Dart lanes depend on this task, so the generated Dart parser\\\\\\\\n   243\\\\\\\\t   ;; reaches them through it.\\\\\\\\n   244\\\\\\\\t   :depends [gen:antlr]\\\\\\\\n   245\\\\\\\\t   ;; Process B of the R5 slice is a whole program rather than a test\\\\\\\\n   246\\\\\\\\t   ;; namespace, and this project's cljd.core carries the Flutter extensions,\\\\\\\\n   247\\\\\\\\t   ;; so only an ahead-of-time build is a peer the plain Dart VM can start.\\\\\\\\n   248\\\\\\\\t   ;; It is compiled alone and first: the test build rewrites the same\\\\\\\\n   249\\\\\\\\t   ;; cljd-out tree, so a peer built after it would import a tree it does\\\\\\\\n   250\\\\\\\\t   ;; not match.  The R5 cross-host tests spawn this one exe from the JVM\\\\\\\\n   251\\\\\\\\t   ;; and Node lanes, so `bb test` builds it first; a bare `bb test:clj` or\\\\\\\\n   252\\\\\\\\t   ;; `bb test:cljs` without it skips those tests with a printed notice\\\\\\\\n   253\\\\\\\\t   ;; rather than failing.\\\\\\\\n   254\\\\\\\\t   :task (do (shell \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mkdir -p build\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\")\\\\\\\\n   255\\\\\\\\t             (shell \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"clojure -M:clojuredart:cljd compile yin.repl.slice-peer\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\")\\\\\\\\n   256\\\\\\\\t             (shell \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"dart compile exe lib/cljd-out/yin/repl/slice-peer.dart -o build/yin-repl-peer\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"))}\\\\\\\\n   257\\\\\\\\t\\\\\\\\n   258\\\\\\\\t  build:demo\\\\\\\\n   259\\\\\\\\t  {:doc \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Release-compile the browser demo (shadow-cljs build :demo) to public/js/main.js\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\n   260\\\\\\\\t   ;; The demo pulls in yang.python.antlr.parser, whose JavaScript\\\\\\\\n   261\\\\\\\\t   ;; recognizers live in build/antlr/python3/js (a :cljs classpath root),\\\\\\\\n   262\\\\\\\\t   ;; so a clean checkout generates them before compiling.\\\\\\\\n   263\\\\\\\\t   :depends [deps:npm gen:antlr]\\\\\\\\n   264\\\\\\\\t   :task (shell \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"clj -M:cljs -m shadow.cljs.devtools.cli release demo\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\")}\\\\\\\\n   265\\\\\\\\t\\\\\\\\n   266\\\\\\\\t  ;; Fast default lanes: no ^:slow test, no dao.test-slow/guard body.\\\\\\\\n   267\\\\\\\\t  test:clj {:doc \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"JVM tests, fast: skips ^:slow ones; the DHT process test needs the Node REPL build\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\n   268\\\\\\\\t            :depends [build:yin-repl-node gen:antlr]\\\\\\\\n   269\\\\\\\\t            :task (shell \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"clojure -M:test -e :slow\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\")}\\\\\\\\n   270\\\\\\\\t\\\\\\\\n   271\\\\\\\\t  check:node-discovery\\\\\\\\n   272\\\\\\\\t  {:doc \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Babashka-only, no natives: scan deps.edn :paths + :cljs :extra-paths for .cljc/.cljs namespaces outside test/ matching shadow-cljs.edn :test :ns-regexp (default -test$); fail before Node discovery can load JVM-only code. Rename the ns or guard it with reader conditionals. Self-test: bb src/dev/check_node_discovery_test.clj\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\n   273\\\\\\\\t   :task (shell {:shutdown nil} \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"bb src/dev/check_node_discovery.clj\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\")}\\\\\\\\n   274\\\\\\\\t\\\\\\\\n   275\\\\\\\\t  test:cljs {:doc \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Node tests, fast: dao.test-slow guarded bodies print SKIP; needs the Node REPL build\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\n   276\\\\\\\\t             :depends [check:node-discovery build:yin-repl-node]\\\\\\\\n   277\\\\\\\\t             :task (shell \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"clj -M:cljs -m shadow.cljs.devtools.cli compile test\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\")}\\\\\\\\n   278\\\\\\\\t\\\\\\\\n   279\\\\\\\\t  test:cljd {:doc \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Dart tests, fast: aggregated shards via src/dev/cljd_agg.clj; guarded bodies print SKIP\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\n   280\\\\\\\\t             :depends [build:yin-repl-peer]\\\\\\\\n   281\\\\\\\\t             :task (shell \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"bb src/dev/cljd_agg.clj\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\")}\\\\\\\\n   282\\\\\\\\t\\\\\\\\n   283\\\\\\\\t  ;; Every test, slow ones included (about 20+ minutes on the JVM).\\\\\\\\n   284\\\\\\\\t  test:all:clj {:doc \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Every JVM test, ^:slow included (20+ minutes); for unattended runs\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\n   285\\\\\\\\t                :depends [build:yin-repl-node gen:antlr]\\\\\\\\n   286\\\\\\\\t                :task (shell \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"clojure -M:test\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\")}\\\\\\\\n   287\\\\\\\\t\\\\\\\\n   288\\\\\\\\t  test:all:cljs {:doc \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Every Node test, guarded slow bodies included (sets DATOM_SLOW_TESTS=1)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\